        "markdown": "# Participation\n\nA time-bounded connection between a person or organization and an event, preserving capacity and epistemic status.\n\n## Required fields\n\n- `title`\n- `participationKind`\n- `subjectRef`\n- `eventRef`\n\n## Provenance boundary\n\nDo not embed source collections. Connect contested or checkable assertions through Claim → Evidence → Source.",
